{"id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:unit-normal","title":"def:unit-normal","path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.md","line":1575,"body":"","kind":"definition","status":"not_started","tex":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex#def:unit-normal","uses":["[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:normal-space]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","label":"def:unit-normal","line":2650,"source":"\\begin{definition}[Unit Normal]\n\\label{def:unit-normal}\n\n\\uses{def:normal-space}\n\n\n\n\nIf $F:M\\to\\widetilde M$ immerses $M$ in $(\\widetilde M,\\widetilde g)$, a family $N_x\\in T_{F(x)}\\widetilde M$ is a \\emph{unit normal} when\n\\[\n\\widetilde g_{F(x)}(N_x,dF_xv)=0\\quad(v\\in T_xM),\\qquad \\widetilde g_{F(x)}(N_x,N_x)=1.\n\\]\n\\end{definition}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Definition</div></section>[Unit Normal] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6465663a756e69742d6e6f726d616c\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Anormal-space\">↗ def:normal-space</a> <p></p>If <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$F:M\\to \\widetilde M$\">$F:M\\to \\widetilde M$</span> immerses <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$M$\">$M$</span> in <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(\\widetilde M,\\widetilde g)$\">$(\\widetilde M,\\widetilde g)$</span>, a family <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$N_x\\in T_{F(x)}\\widetilde M$\">$N_x\\in T_{F(x)}\\widetilde M$</span> is a <em>unit normal</em> when <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[  \\widetilde g_{F(x)}(N_x,dF_xv)=0\\quad (v\\in T_xM),\\qquad \\widetilde g_{F(x)}(N_x,N_x)=1.  \\]\">\\[  \\widetilde g_{F(x)}(N_x,dF_xv)=0\\quad (v\\in T_xM),\\qquad \\widetilde g_{F(x)}(N_x,N_x)=1.  \\]</span> ","warnings":[]},"previous":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:interior-multiplication","next":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:adapted-frame-cons-normal","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:normal-space","title":"def:normal-space","label":"def:normal-space"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:adapted-frame-cons-normal","title":"lem:adapted-frame-cons-normal","label":"lem:adapted-frame-cons-normal"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-volume-form-formula","title":"prop:hypersurface-volume-form-formula","label":"prop:hypersurface-volume-form-formula"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-orientation","title":"def:induced-orientation","label":"def:induced-orientation"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-volume-form-induced","title":"prop:hypersurface-volume-form-induced","label":"prop:hypersurface-volume-form-induced"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:smooth-unit-normal-field","title":"def:smooth-unit-normal-field","label":"def:smooth-unit-normal-field"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:adapted-frame-smooth","title":"lem:adapted-frame-smooth","label":"lem:adapted-frame-smooth"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:normal-restrict-neg-member","title":"lem:normal-restrict-neg-member","label":"lem:normal-restrict-neg-member"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:two-unit-normals","title":"lem:two-unit-normals","label":"lem:tw